
# ESD Visitboard — Master Implementation Prompt (v2)
## Comprehensive Backend + Frontend Update Spec for esd-visitboard.netlify.app

**Purpose:** this is the consolidated, final-form prompt for updating the live site at [esd-visitboard.netlify.app](https://esd-visitboard.netlify.app/). It supersedes the separate "unified prototype" and "refined scheduling logic" prompts by merging them into one document, organized the way the actual codebase should be organized: sections, considerations, automations, uploads, and exports all called out explicitly so nothing gets built as a one-off. It is grounded in the live site's current demo copy ("Pick a visit. The board checks every calendar, rules out who cannot go, and explains who it would send"), the ESD Scheduling Manual, and the full meeting-notes transcript reviewed across this thread.

**Roster constraint, confirmed again here:** every rule below uses only the coordinators already on the dashboard — **Emma, Sanjana, Lauren, Makenzie, Ramiro, Maggie**. The latest research-report draft introduces additional names (Cali, Kim, Sophia) and reworded attributes (e.g., "Emma available only Tuesdays & Fridays," a three-metric ranking order) that are **not reflected in the manual excerpts reviewed and are not part of the current roster** — they are intentionally excluded from this spec. If Cali/Kim/Sophia are real, current lab members, add them as a separate follow-up once their reliability/tech-training data is confirmed against the manual directly; do not merge unverified names into the live roster silently.

